[[Image:Romanian hay.jpg|thumb|A haystack]]

===Etymology===
From {{compound|hay|stack|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈheɪˌstæk/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-haystack.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[mound]], [[pile]], or [[stack]] of stored hay.
# {{lb|en|canoeing}} A standing wave in a rapid.

